  "releaseNotes": "Fix: authentication is the same on the Flurl and the custom HttpClient paths. OAuth2 now works with WebApplicationFactory (the token is requested through the test client) and the token is reused between requests; an empty credential is sent as it is. No code changes needed from 6.12.2; a test that expected an empty Basic, Bearer or ApiKey value to throw now sees the request sent. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
